# Canonical Cursor skill: .cursor/skills/project-analyze/SKILL.md
# This file is the original note. Prefer the SKILL.md.

# Skill: PROJECT_ANALYZE (Stage 1 — always first)
# Purpose: Analyze decompiled dump in project/ for technology, signatures,
# branding/copyright assets, styling, and structure. Recommend kotlin or unity template.

SKILL_NAME=project-analyze
STAGE=1

INPUT=project/ (decompiled/extracted app)

OBJECTIVES=
1. Detect original technology (Kotlin, Java, Flutter, RN, Unity, etc.) with confidence.
2. Classify app_category: game vs non_game.
3. Audit branding/copyright: icons, logos, fonts, themes, third-party marks (observation only).
4. Extract manifest, permissions, SDKs, native libs, UI/navigation clues.
5. Set recommended_template: unity_app_template (game) OR kotlin_app_template (non-game).
6. Suggest project folder name (e.g. calculator, expense-tracker, 2d-game).

OUTPUT=analysis/analysis-report.md, technology-detection.json, reconstruction-plan.md

NEXT=project-create
